# Project rule bootstrap

Before analyzing or changing the project, read `AGENTS.md` and every applicable file in `rules/**/*.mdc` completely. Treat those files as the source of truth for architecture, Next.js, performance, animation, accessibility, SEO, media, security, and deployment decisions.

For Next.js behavior, also read the relevant installed guide under `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before writing code. Do not rely on remembered framework behavior.
